@JeffyGPT.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5008

### Health
GET {{JeffyGPT.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Chat
POST {{JeffyGPT.Api_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "hello" }
  ]
}

###

### Chat stream
POST {{JeffyGPT.Api_HostAddress}}/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/x-ndjson

{
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "hello" }
  ]
}

